---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import { publishedArticles } from '../lib/publication';
import ArticleCards from '../components/ArticleCards.astro';
const {articles,unavailable}=await publishedArticles();
const latest=articles.filter(a=>!a.withdrawn).slice(0,4);
---
<Page title="Technology, examined" home>
<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title"><img class="hero-image" src="/assets/device-concept.png" alt="" width="1672" height="941" fetchpriority="high"/>
<div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Technology, examined</p><h1 id="hero-title">The next era.<br/><span>Under the lens.</span></h1><p class="hero-intro">Independent technology journalism, deep analysis and everything in between. The devices, the silicon and the ideas that move the world forward.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-white" href="#latest">Explore the latest →</a><a class="button button-outline" href="#about">About PhoneFuturist</a></div><div class="values"><div><strong>Independent</strong><span>No brand bias</span></div><div><strong>Informed</strong><span>Evidence first</span></div><div><strong>Global</strong><span>Tech without borders</span></div></div></div>
<div class="hero-caption"><p class="eyebrow">Beyond the surface</p><h2>Every detail.<br/>A bigger picture.</h2><p>From the glass to the silicon, understanding what comes next starts with asking better questions.</p><a href="/articles">Explore our reporting →</a></div><small class="image-disclosure">Concept illustration · AI-generated</small></section>
<section id="latest" class="latest-section"><div class="latest-main"><div class="section-heading"><div><h2>The latest</h2><p>Top stories, in context.</p></div><a href="/articles">View all articles →</a></div>{latest.length ? <ArticleCards articles={latest}/> : <div class="empty-news"><span class="eyebrow">The newsroom</span><h3>{unavailable?'Reporting is temporarily unavailable.':'Our first stories start here.'}</h3><p>{unavailable?'Please check back shortly.':'Original reporting takes work. Our writers are preparing sourced stories for editorial review.'}</p><a href="/studio">Enter the Studio ↗</a></div>}</div><aside class="news-rail"><div class="rail-panel"><h3>Explore the coverage</h3>{[['01','News','What happened. Why it matters.','news'],['02','Reports','A closer look at the evidence.','reports'],['03','Leaks','Rumors, with their sources.','leaks'],['04','Analysis','The context behind the headlines.','analysis']].map(([n,t,d,s])=><a class="coverage-row" href={'/articles?section='+s}><span>{n}</span><div><strong>{t}</strong><small>{d}</small></div><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></a>)}</div><div class="rail-panel brief"><span class="eyebrow">Your next perspective</span><h3>Make yourself at home.</h3><p>One PhoneFuturist account. Start with the stories.</p><a class="button" href="/join">Create an account →</a></div></aside></section>
<section class="about-section" id="about"><div><p class="eyebrow">Independent thinking. Informed perspective.</p><h2>Technology moves fast.<br/><span>Understanding goes deeper.</span></h2></div><div><p>PhoneFuturist covers smartphones, laptops, chips, displays, cameras and software — with original reporting and structured sourcing.</p><p>We separate what is confirmed from what is claimed. Sources and corrections belong alongside the story, where readers can see them.</p><a class="text-link" href="/articles">Meet your next read →</a></div></section>
</Page>
